    <string name="location_disclosure_title">Use your location?</string>
    <string name="location_disclosure_body">KlipSilo uses your current location only when you tap Location. The coordinates are stored as a clip on this device. To show an address, the coordinates may be sent to your device\'s geocoding service (usually Google on phones with Google Play). KlipSilo has no servers and does not show ads. You can deny this and still use the rest of the app.</string>
